Risk Terminal data
==================

Unless a release's own LICENSE file says otherwise for a specific table, the
data and documentation in this repository are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

You may share and adapt the material, including commercially, provided you give
appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether changes were made.
Attribution should name the release id and the model versions listed in that
release's README.md.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Exceptions, stated per table in each release's LICENSE file:

- Office-holder facts sourced from Wikidata are released under CC0 1.0
  Universal, matching their upstream terms:
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
- Portrait columns are a URL, a credit and a per-row image licence. No image
  file is redistributed. Read each row's own licence before reusing a portrait.

Third-party editorial text (headlines, article text, feed summaries) is not
licensed by this repository.

No warranty: the data are provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. Values
are readings of observed conditions at each row's own timestamp. They are not
predictions and not advice.
